{"script":"yd_036_07","des":"","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]就像你们看到的那样，水占师之环其实是彻头彻尾以对塞瓦的崇敬之情为纽带结成的组织，[r]种族什么的根本就不在我们的考虑范围之内。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]只要尊崇水神大人，无论什么种族，都可以成为我们的兄弟，[r]拥有学习水占术的资格，决定最终成就的只是个人的才能。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]之所以会形成现在这样，以水生属魔人为主，纯血人类为辅的构成形式……[r][l]我想可能是因为其它种属的魔人更难接受水神大人的感召吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}